--- !u!114 &35070008
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 35070005}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 7684a7be71ec4ca42a8995e99203673e, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  dialogue:
    name: djinn
    options:
    - '*Simulate a fart inside the bucket.*'
    - Why were you waiting in a bucket?
    - I'm so sorry, I had no idea you were in there!
    - I wish to be able to travel through time!
    - What happens If I say 'I wish for more wishes'.
    - I wish for you to be happy!
    - I wish for FEWER WISHES!
    - I wish to double my genies!
    - I wish to be lucky!
    - I wish to date the queen!
    - I wish for really awesome to happen to me!
    - I wish to keep humanity safe!
    - Let me try pull you out!
    - Wait... Since I've already used 3 wishes, I cant wish any more times?
    - Since you're stuck in there, Take this gift... Might be bored for a while.
    - If only I could pick you up.
    - I'll still date you.
    - I'd love to have a second date!
    respones:
    - '*You get punched hard in the butt so you get off the bucket. You''re lucky
      the robot doesn''t bruise.*

      ARE YOU TRYING TO SUFFOCATE ME? I can''t
      just leave this bucket you know!'
    - I can't just leave the bucket. I'm stuck here. I've been bound to this god
      forsaken bucket for many schlooms.
    - Ahh it's okay pal.  I've been bound to this god forsaken bucket for many schlooms.
    - ShaBANG! You can now walk through objects that tell time!.... This also means
      you can't wear a watch.
    - You just wished for another wish, but I can't do that. Did you really expect
      that to work? You're just down a wish now... You need to be more careful with
      your wording.
    - ShaBANG! That wish was so kind of you it made me happy... But now I'm sad you
      just wasted a wish...
    - Um... Okay...? Sha...bang... There wow you get one less wish, wow you're really
      wasting my time.
    - Well, I never said I was a genie, because I'm not... so you have zero genies,
      and even if I WAS a genie, you don't own me. So... SHABANG, you went from ZERO
      genies to... ZERO genies!
    - Hey that was actually a cool wish! Okay here goes.. SHABANG! Oh.... there was
      no downside to that wish... I guess that was your luck... and you didn't specify
      how long for... Hey that was still a cool wish!
    - SHABANG! Your next match on the dating app will be... The queen... Bit rude
      that you wished that right in front of me though...
    - SHABANG! So, What do you think? Pretty awesome, right?!
    - Humanity? Maybe you mean you wish to keep a huge manatee safe! That's a nice
      wish, you're so kind! SHABANG!!
    - '*You try to pull the alien out the bucket, but they didn''t budge.*

      Great,
      now I''m stuck in a bucket AND I have slimy hands, thanks.'
    - Exactly... The world is so cruel.
    - Hey, this is pretty cool! It's hard to grip, and it's satisfying to squish!
      I actually like this, thanks! I've been so used to giving wishes, I've never
      really recieved anything.
    - But you can't, why? Because I'm too heavy? Whatever.
    - Well I DID grant you three wishes. so it's the least you can do.
    - Well, I hope you'll come back then, I'll just wait right here.
    actions:
    - '*Walking along the beach is getting tiring, there''s a bucket on the beach,
      so you decide to sit and have a rest... When suddenly.*

      Hey! Who turned
      out the lights?'
    - The only way I can be set free, is for me to grant someone THREE wishes to
      one glomp! Pretty cool, huh? So... What do you wish for?
    - You know, thinking about it, I probably should've told you that my wish granting
      comes with a drawback that all my wishes have a twist. It's not something I
      can control, it just happens. Oh well, anyway... What is your SECOND wish!
    - You're on your LAST wish! I'll finally be free! This has been fun... Thank
      you for everything... Okay, what's your final wish?
    - Wait, I'm not free from the bucket?  What...? So... I'm just a wish granting
      glomp.... that's stuck in a bucket? AND YOU'VE ALREADY USED YOUR WISHES?!?
      WHY IS THE WORLD SO CRUEL!?
    - Well... I'm stuck in here, seemingly forever. So we'll have time for a second
      date, but you will have to come to me.
    - You go on ahead. Don't wait up. I'm gonna stay here for... forever I guess...
      Have a good evening.
