--- !u!114 &307068923
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 307068920}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 7684a7be71ec4ca42a8995e99203673e, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  dialogue:
    name: luma
    options:
    - Oh my god, please don't scare me like that, I was entranced with them.
    - '*Wait for the alien to notice you.*'
    - '*Gently touch the alien on the shoulder.*'
    - Is that Shakespeare?
    - You have such a way with words Luma!
    - "*Touch the alien's arm.* \nThat was beautiful."
    - Bound to the stars?
    - You sound very free, enlightened even.
    - Your wisdom is as vast as the universe itself.
    - I cant do that, but I can cook for you while you stargaze.
    - We can engage in combat... of the mind.
    - "*Touch the aliens head.* \nI can be or do anything you like."
    - Experiencing the universe isn't really my thing...
    - What do you mean?
    - "*Hold the alien's hand.* \nI'll do anything with you."
    - I'm not so sure about this...
    - I'm so that you trust me enough... I'm ready.
    - I love the stars enough to not fear the night... Think about it.
    - As much as I want to help you, I'm sorry, I don't think we are compatible.
      You seem to be more in love with the universe than me.
    - Let's take things slow. You don't want to rush something as precious as this,
      rome wasn't built in a day.
    - '*Open the zip.*'
    respones:
    - Oh my god, please don't scare me like that, I was entranced with them.
    - The alien stargazes for a long while, Eventually they notice you, and smiles.
    - Oh I'm sorry, I didn't hear you enter, I was just so mesmerised, thank you
      for snapping me out of my hypnosis.
    - Is what who? Shakespeare? Who is this that you speak of. That is the question.
    - I do try my best!
    - Oh- was it? hm... I guess it was...
    - Yes, keep up. I like to date people with compassion and brains, not brutish
      glorps. I meant bound in a metaphorical sense.
    - I wish... They entrap me with their beauty, I am bound in a metaphorical sense.
    - They enthrawl me with their beauty, I am bound in a metaphorical sense. I am
      feeling something from you, also.
    - I'm not just star 'gazing'... I am ADMIRING! APPRECIATING.
    - Hmm... Yes... But why call it a combat, we are not debating, we are sharing
      inteligence, and curiousity.. we are not BRUTES. Hmm 'Combat'.
    - Oh, umm, yes... well..... I am not used to situations such as this. I have
      only heard such tales in glorpio and glorpiette.
    - Trust me, this is a unique experence you won't want to miss. The only thing
      we have to fear, is fear itself.
    - You'll see in a moment, at the moment, you are a small ant in a small garden,
      after this, you will be enlightened, no longer an ant, but a cosmic god.
    - That's what I like to hear. I like that you're not afraid of the unknown. The
      only thing we have to fear, is fear itself. metaphorically, you are a small
      ant in a small garden, after this, you will be enlightened, no longer an ant,
      but a cosmic god.
    - This lack of passion and curiousity will never reward you, be the cat... be
      curious...
    - I like this curiousity inside you, fascinating.
    - SO THOUGHT PROVOKING! Wow, what a good proverb. I've been matched in my own
      game...
    - Hmm... You are correct, my love for you versus the stars is like a water droplet
      in a vast ocean.
    - Rome? I don't know a rome, but you do make a good point, maybe I was getting
      carried away. I think this date is over, I must get back to the stars. Come
      back again sometime...
    - You slowly open the zip. and a mist with a mesmerising glimmer flows out...
      the alien starts to maniacally laugh as the mist envelops them, maybe it's
      best you don't touch the mist, the date has been successful but it's time to
      leave.
    actions:
    - There is an alien looking through a telescope, mesmerised, they don't notice
      you enter.
    - The stars, they are so beautiful, like cherry blossom petals in an infinitely
      spanning lake... My name is.... Luma.
    - I admire the stars because they were born with something I was not, freedom.
      I have been bound to the stars for generations.
    - Do you like poetry? Philosophy? I need a glorp with inteligence. Wisdom.
    - We've gotten to know eachother well enough now I feel. Do you want to experience
      the bliss of the universe together?
    - I want to show you something, something so personal to me that I haven't shown
      it to anyone in many schlooms. are you prepared for that?
    - Here, open my zip, I can't reach it myself, and usually people don't trust
      me enough to get close to me. Maybe I am rushing this, only do this if you're
      sure..
    - I'll look for your face in the stars... but for now... Goodbye.
