--- !u!114 &486209027
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 486209024}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 7684a7be71ec4ca42a8995e99203673e, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  dialogue:
    name: finona
    options:
    - Hello yourself, you look Fintastic gorgeous!
    - '*Bow nervously.*'
    - I didn't realise I was going on a date with 3 people.
    - Don't get cocky, I only knew your name from the app.
    - Of course, The Offishal Finona.
    - Finona, nope Doesn't ring a bell.
    - Money Schmoney. I don't have any and I don't want any when I can have you.
    - I already have money, but you're worth more than money can buy.
    - Oh, I AM here for the money. But you're a very attractive bonus ;).
    - I'd do all your dishes, your chores, and run you baths every day.
    - I'd tell you how beautiful you look, and take you out to dinner every night.
    - '*Give crown.*

      I''d spoil you with gifts like this this every day.'
    - I'd take you to a luxury sushi resteraunt.
    - I have a nice glorptalian place down glorpstreet.
    - I know a local place called 'Prima'.
    - With your busy lifestyle, I'm not sure if this will work out.
    - It's been a lovely date. Lets do it again sometime.
    - That's okay. Thing one and thing two look like they need a nap anyway.
    respones:
    - Ugh. Disgusting. I expected differently from your profile.
    - I'm not the Queen Honey, you don't have to be so nervous!
    - Haha you're funny... These are my bodyguards.
    - I like witty. I DON'T like rude.
    - Yes, that's me.
    - I guess you're gonna have to get to know me then...
    - You DON'T have money? I'm not a shallow glorp but I want someone with ambition,
      not a dead end...
    - You're right, I am worth more than money. I have Gillionares chasing my fin
      constantly, what makes you so special?
    - You're a cheeky glorp arent you...
    - Umm, ick, that's bare minimum. I said spoil me.
    - Hm that does sound sweet... but not exactly princess teatment.
    - A FANCY CROWN?!? Aw you're saying I'm you're princess? That's such a sweet
      gift. It looks authentic as well! "Made...in... China.." Oooh where's that,
      sounds expensive!
    - "Sushi, SUSHI?!? You have some nerve. \n*The bodyguards look like they want
      to punch you.*"
    - Glorptalian is nice, but any suiter can take me to a nice resteraunt.
    - '''Prima'' sounds, expensive... sounds..... Premium. And it''s local? You really
      do know all the hidden gems.'
    - Yeah, I wasn't really feeling the vibe anyway...
    - Yeah, it has... okay, I'll get my manager to text you.
    - Hahaha, okay funny glorp, I like you. Let's do it again sometime.
    actions:
    - '*Date start, you''re sitting in the booth of a cafe, when your date walks
      in, closely followed by two bigger aliens. People start whispering and pointing
      at your date, you''re almost.... hypnotised by the tail on your date.*'
    - My name's Finona, but you already knew that.
    - So, Prettyglorp, how do I know you're not trying to date me for my money?
    - Now, I'm not the queen, but I do like to be spoiled sometimes. What would you
      do to make me feel special?
    - If you were to take me out for dinner, I want a true and honest choice from
      you. I want to trust and rely on your opinion.
    - Surprisingly, this date has gone pretty well, but as a celebrity, obviously
      you know my schedule is VERY tight so we have to wrap it up here.
