--- !u!114 &728984416
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 728984413}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 7684a7be71ec4ca42a8995e99203673e, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  dialogue:
    name: swamp pick ne
    options:
    - '*Jokingly.*

      How did you know?'
    - Why would I show up if it was an accident?
    - No, It was on purpose.
    - Why don't you try improve yourself?
    - You have to stop putting yourself down! That's the only thing holding you back,
      I promise!
    - You're not that ugly.
    - I need you to have more confidence in yourself.
    - Are you sure that's the reason?
    - I'd give you a chance.
    - What a weird thing to say.
    - So honourable of you!
    - Respect.
    - I don't believe you were reading that.
    - I didn't know you read femiglorp literature.
    - '*Reach into the lake, try grab a book and give it to the alien *'
    - I'd love a second date, but you need more confidence!
    - It has been... interesting!
    - This date was better than I expected, but let's take it slow.
    respones:
    - So I was right? I knew it... The ugly glorps don't even get a chance.
    - Like I said, you just felt so bad for me. A pretty glorp like you would never
      go on a date with someone as ugly as me.
    - It was? You don't have to lie to me, I know you don't actually want to be here...
      Right? You would never go on a date with someone as ugly as me.
    - So you think I'm ugly? I knew it. Don't worry, everyone thinks that.
    - Sorry. It's just hard to do when you're so ugly. Unless you don't think I'm
      ugly?
    - You don't have to lie to me... Wait... You really think I'm not ugly?
    - Yep.. Everybody loves to be friends with the nice glorp, but nobody wants to
      date the nice glorp... Typical.
    - Why else would it be? Obviously I'm just so ugly that nobody likes me.
    - You're just saying that to be nice. You don't mean that, right?
    - Yet again, my kindness is seen as weird. Yep, typical nice glorps finish last.
    - Is that sarcastic? Are you making fun of me? It's okay... I'm used to being
      made fun of for being so nice...
    - I'm so glad you understand, I knew I liked you for a reason... NOT LIKE THAT....
      Unless... You feel the same way? NO, of course you dont...
    - I WAS, but since it's in the lake I guess you'll have to trust me.
    - Yeah, I just think that kind of literature is deeper and more meaningful than
      most other books.
    - NO IT'S OKAY! I-..... whats this? A rock? Wait no, thats... GOLD?!? YOU'RE
      GIVING ME GOLD?!? I knew you were different from the other glorps! You really
      do like how nice I am!
    - I have confidence... I'm just realistic in my expectations. I know what I bring
      to the table and it's nothing compared to someone like you.
    - Interesting? Like you're interested in me?
    - Better than expected? Finally, you really understand me. You see my kind personality
      on the inside.
    actions:
    - Hey... You probably swiped right by accident, and felt so bad for me that you
      showed up out of pity, is that right?
    - Maybe If I wasn't ugly, I'd get more chances at love.
    - Hey, do you think you'd ever give a nice glorp a chance? Everyone else I've
      tried to date breaks up with me because I'm too ugly, even though I treated
      them better than anyone.
    - If I could, I'd take all tentacle cramps away from every glorp, so only I'd
      have to experience them. You don't deserve that pain.
    - I've had the worst day, I was reading my book about femiglorp literature and
      I dropped it in the swamp. YOU DONT HAVE TO GET IT, I was just telling you.
    - I feel like we're getting pretty close! Not like you'd date me though.. Unless?
      Nah I'm joking... Unless you DO like me?
    - I know you probably don't want another date.. But if you do, I'll be here.
