--- !u!114 &1130998278
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 1130998275}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 7684a7be71ec4ca42a8995e99203673e, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  dialogue:
    name: hotel
    options:
    - Hello?
    - Are you a Log?
    - Oh I'm sorry I didn't see you.
    - 'Ah well I brought flowers! You can decorate the hotel with them! '
    - 'You''re the manager? What do you manage? '
    - I've never seen a hotel so small before!
    - 'Owning the hotel with you would being a dream! '
    - 'Do i get free breakfast? '
    - I like a cozy lifestyle!
    - 'A Harem all for me? '
    - 701? that's quite a lot, I will do my best.
    - I can handle all of you. At once.
    - 'Whatever is playing at the time is what I enjoy, I''m not picky! '
    - It's a bit hard to hear the music from out here.
    - I like a mix of trending generic songs!
    - My tentacle might cramp up signing all of those, let's avoid it...
    - I'd happily sign every one, as long as it means we can date.
    - Don't worry, I'll pay for all our dates, for all of you. You'll never have
      to worry about money again.
    respones:
    - 'Hello? you almost kill 701 men with families and your only words are HELLO? '
    - Do I look like a log? I'm the manager!
    - Ahh its whatever pal. Just be more careful okay? One wrong step could crush
      all of us.
    - "Decorations Manager: Are you saying the hotel looks ugly? You think it needs
      those huge ugly flowers? \n(Hotel Guest: I have hayfever.)"
    - "Manager Manager: Can't you tell by my nametag, i'm the Manager Manager...
      I manage the Managers. \n(The manager manager's assistant: it's true!)"
    - 'Building manager: A very efficient building isn''t it! It''s my teams magnum
      opus.'
    - "Hiring Manager: Who said anything about owning the hotel? \n(Hotel Guest:
      You haven't even set foot in the hotel yet... Not that you could.)"
    - "Head Chef: Employees only... \n(Hotel Guest: Who does he think he is.)"
    - 'Relations Manager: You sound like the perfect candidate for the role.'
    - "Relations Manager: How Unprofessional!!! \n(Hotel Guest: I'm kinda into it.)"
    - 'Relations manager: Not confident, but willing to try... Noted...'
    - "Relations Manager: Did somebody turn up the AC in the hotel? \n(Hotel Guest:
      Boss, are you sweating?)"
    - "Lobby Manager: I asked for YOUR preference, and you don't even answer? Where's
      your initiative. \n(Hotel Guest: How rude!)"
    - 'Lobby Manager: Hmm,,, oh well!'
    - "Lobby Manager: Perfect, that's exactly what we have queued for 14 more hours!
      \n*Quiet groaning from people waiting in the lobby.*"
    - We regret to inform you that it is a requirement for all employees- Sorry...
      'Date applicants' to sign a prenup.
    - Very willing to sign... Very willing? or very lacking trust. We shall see,
      let's have another interview- I mean, DATE soon.
    - All of us?.... This could boost business efficiency tenfold... PERECT! YOU'RE
      HIRED! I mean- LETS GET MARRIED!
    actions:
    - "*Walking by the river, you see a fallen tree in your way, you lift your foot
      to step over it, when you hear a cacophony of screams.* \nHey watch where you're
      stepping, would ya? Yeah, down here.\n \t"
    - 'The manager manager: If you couldn''t already tell, this "log" is actually
      a hotel where I and 700 others work. Now if you don''t mind I have to get back
      to work.'
    - "Relations Manager: So how do you feel about staying long term at the hotel?
      \n*The hotel doesn't travel much... or at all.*"
    - 'Relations Manager: We come in a full package. all 701 of us, are you okay
      with polyamory?'
    - 'Lobby Manager: What kind of music would you like to hear while in the lobby?'
    - "Sales Manager: This date is pretty going pretty well, but now it's time to
      talk business... Are you willing to get a prenup? \n*That's 701 signatures.*"
    - 'Manager: This has been a very informative date. We shall be in contact.'
