--- !u!114 &1320071324
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 1320071321}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 7684a7be71ec4ca42a8995e99203673e, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  dialogue:
    name: tarrant
    options:
    - Your profile said you liked hats. So I brought you a brand new hat!
    - That's the coolest hat i've ever seen.
    - '*Politely shake one of their arms.*'
    - If you want to be more approachable, try wearing gloves.
    - I thought they were your ribcage!
    - Your claws are so fashionable! I couldn't be afraid!
    - '*Give hat.*

      Why don''t you wear this hat I got you as a gift?'
    - Lose the hat, I want to see your beautiful hair!
    - '*Touch Tarrant''s arm.*

      A watch would fit with your style!'
    - You didn't poop yourself, did you?
    - Tarrant, you're so kind, I could never be disgusted by you!
    - "*Hold Tarrant's hands.* \nI'm ready."
    - WE NEED TO TAKE YOU TO A DOCTOR!
    - Aw that's not disgusting, Tarrant!
    - "*Poke Tarrants brain.* \nWhoa..."
    - Tarrant, I have something to tell you too. I'm actually.... A human.
    - Your fashion, exposed brain, and 6 arms that give awesome hugs is exactly why
      I like you!
    - '*Hug Tarrant.*

      Yes!!'
    respones:
    - You don't like Tarrant's hat? But... Tarrant worked hard on that :((
    - Really?.... Tarrant feels.... happy..... :)
    - Your tentacle feels... funny... Tarrant likes!! :33
    - Tarrant is more fashionable than you, and will not take fashion advice from
      you. >://
    - Tarrant gets that a lot...
    - Tarrant has studied fashion for this exact reason!! :DD
    - Tarrant can't size down. And Tarrant will NOT size down >:I
    - Hmm... but Tarrant doesn't have any hair... :')
    - Tarrant is feeling... Glorpflies but in Tarrant's heart... :s
    - NOOO TARRANT WOULD NEVER DO THAT!! >n<
    - Hmm.. Okay... really? Tarrant isn't sure. But will trust you anyway. :')
    - O...okay.... :3
    - NOOOO!!!! >-< TARRANT JUST HAS A CONDITION!!
    - Tarrant is so happy you think that! ^_^
    - OooOo please be gentle! Tarrant's brain's sensitive! :3 .... That's why Tarrant
      wears a hat all the time... Tarrant is so glad you don't mind it!
    - Tarrant doesn't like when you joke about that kind of stuff. :// That's not
      something to joke about.
    - Aww, Tarrant is so glad you think that! Tarrant likes your strange tentacle
      too!
    - Ouhh >o< TARRANT WANTS TO SKIP DATING AND GET MARRIED!!1!!1!!!
    actions:
    - '*You arrive at the date location, but nobody''s there. You hear shuffling,
      and see a large stylish hat shuffles across the floor. the hat looks up at
      you, and you see an alien, with what looks to claws coming out of the side
      of it looking up to you.*'
    - You're not afraid of Tarrants hands? Normally people get disgusted or run away.
    - Tarrant is SUUPER into fashion, do you know anything about it?! Doesn't really
      look like it :/ But what would you do to improve Tarrant's style? :3
    - Tarranat will be honest...  You are very Hattractive, and Tarrant wants to
      get closer to you but is worried that you will be disgusted... :((
    - '*Tarrant takes their hat off their lack of hair  is not too surprising...
      but... they''re not just bald, there''s a split in their head their brain is
      exposed?!?*'
    - Now that Tarrant has shared their secret with you... Do you still want to date
      me? ://
    - Your date with tarrant seemed to have gone well. Time to head back.
