--- !u!114 &1899850858
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 1899850855}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 7684a7be71ec4ca42a8995e99203673e, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  dialogue:
    name: hotel
    options:
    - I can see your glitter.
    - Fairy dust?
    - Oh, I thought all fairies have fairy dust.
    - Don't worry! You're not small at all, I promise!
    - I've met smaller fairies, it's okay!
    - You being so small is cute!
    - She is.
    - I'd never compare you!
    - You are!
    - '*Start fanning the fairy. *'
    - Maybe because you're in the sun, move to the shade.
    - Probably because you've got really long hair.
    - You could get more dates if you stopped fishing for compliments.
    - Yeah, I can see why.
    - I'm surprised, you seem like you go on dates a lot.
    - Yes as long as you stop trying to subtly look for compliments.
    - Yes of course!
    - If you start being your honest self next time and drop the act.
    respones:
    - 'OH MY GLORP! NOOO! That''s just my natural sparkle!

      I could never use
      fairy dust like all the other fairies.'
    - Yeah! the stuff that makes most fairies sparkle! I don't use any of that though.
    - That's just my natural sparkle that you can see! That's what you meant right,
      That I'm pretty without fairy dust! Teehee!
    - I'm not? Well.. All the other glorps call me tiny and cute...
    - You have...? Well I'm sure they use a bunch of artificial fairy dust.
    - You think I'm cute? Teehee!
    - Hahaha you're so funny, such a comedian! You don't have to say that just to
      be nice! You can be honest with me!
    - 3Aww you're so kind and thoughtful! But you can be honest! I think we both
      know who you really think is prettier!
    - Really? Ah well I guess that's because I don't use any of that artificial fairy
      dust!
    - Hey stop that!! You're gonna blow me away because I'm so tiny!
    - Hmm noo it wouldn't be that, It's probably because my hair is so healthy and
      luscious.
    - Teehee so you're saying my hair is healthy and lucious? It's all natural you
      know!
    - WHAT?!? ME? I'd never fish for compliments... Other fairies may do that, but
      not me, I'm not like other fairies.
    - Yeah, Most fairies just don't appreciate natural beauty, inside and out.
    - Why is that? Oh because you think I'm so pretty that everyone would want to
      date me? Teehee stop being so silly!
    - I told you I DON'T DO THAT! You're just like all the other glorps, you don't
      see how unique I really am...
    - Really!? I'm so happy! You wont forget me because I'm so unique!
    - Okay.... I guess, I'll try... Next time, I'll properly open up to you...
    actions:
    - I'm so glad you decided to date me! Most glorps don't choose to date a fairy
      that doesn't use fairy dust. I'm not like the other fairies.
    - Since this is our first time meeting in person, are you okay with how small
      and petite I am? All the other fairies are so much bigger than I am...
    - Have you talked to any other glorps other than me?.... Oh you have? Haha......
      But out of the two of us, which one is prettier?
    - I'm so warm! I don't know why, I'm just a vunerable fairy overheating!
    - This date has gone AMAZING! I don't go on dates often because most glorps don't
      like fairy that's so natural like me... Especially other fairies, I get along
      so much better with you.
    - So... Would you... Be willing to go on another date with me? Even though I'm
      so small, and don't use fairy dust?
    - Goodbye! Don't forget me!!!
