--- !u!114 &1920656227
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 1920656224}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 7684a7be71ec4ca42a8995e99203673e, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  dialogue:
    name: kaleen
    options:
    - I am, and you look so gorgeous!
    - Did you bring a vaccum to our date?
    - I am date.
    - I deep clean once a week!
    - I keep things tidy.
    - (brush the aliens shoulder) I can tell, your outfit is so clean.
    - No thanks, please don't touch.
    - I will look presentable for our next date.
    - Oh gosh, yes please!
    - I like how hard working you are!
    - How does it get power.
    - '*Help pick up trash.*'
    - Freaky party trick.
    - Whoa! how did you do that?
    - "*Touch their arm.* \nHow did you do that?"
    - This has been quite tiring. Cleaning isn't a usual date.
    - Thank you, Kaleen. It's been a pleasure.
    - '*Hold Kaleen''s hand.*

      Thank you for today.'
    respones:
    - Too forward for Kaleen, you are dirty glorp.
    - Kaleen did bring vaccum to date, Problem?
    - Good, nice to meet. My name Kaleen.
    - WEEK? No, No. This will not do.
    - Hm. Acceptable. This is ok.
    - Indeed. No wrinkles.
    - You are dirty, and do not want me to clean? Dirty glorp. Kaleen do not like.
    - Next date? You'd better be clean.
    - There you go dear. You are now clean.
    - This is not hard working. If this is your hard work, Kaleen does not want to
      see your easy work.
    - It doesn't need power, It's part of me! I control the suction, and all the
      trash goes in my tummy!
    - You are a kind glorp, but it is faster if I do it. The trash goes right to
      my tummy!
    - It is not trick. My body is... 'freaky'? That makes me so sad.
    - My arms are connected, one goes in, other goes out.
    - You touch me still? Nobody usually touch me after I show them that.
    - Cleaning is good date. You don't like cleaning? You are messy Glorp.
    - Indeed. I enjoyed.
    - Wow. This has now make me flustered. I want second date.
    actions:
    - Hello dear, are you date?
    - I bring vaccum to clean, it brings me much joy. You like to clean also?
    - There is messy, messy wires hanging out from your body. Let me clean.
    - '*Kaleen vaccums up some trash on the beach, but the vaccum isn''t connected
      to anything.*'
    - '*Kaleen stretches their arm to pick up trash, but as one arm extends, the
      other arm shrinks into their body.*'
    - Kaleen is tired. I go home now. My bed calls.
    - Clean your room when you get back. Goodbye.
