--- !u!114 &2013450726
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 2013450721}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 7684a7be71ec4ca42a8995e99203673e, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  dialogue:
    name: flyynt
    options:
    - Were you just.. speaking to that rock? I didn't know geologists did that...
    - Flynnt like Flint? Are you a geologist?
    - That's me! I like your rock collection! You must be a pretty impressive geologist.
    - A "geologist" is somebody who studies rocks, not collects them. They probably
      know more, but their collection isn't as big.
    - How many rocks do you have?
    - I don't think anybody is as... in love... with rocks as you are.
    - Let me guess, your Number 1 is "The Rolling Stones"?
    - That's amazing, I've never met anyone as passionate as you about rocks!
    - There's a magazine called Rocks Monthly? I'll have to subscribe to that.
    - Hey come on now, like you said, it's just one lousy emerald! Your collection
      is still so impressive. No wonder the queen wanted something from it!
    - Wow, you got to meet the queen? I like a Glomp with status.
    - How about this dusty rock on the floor here? It's not much, but maybe it can
      be a placeholder?
    - My tentacle is great at cleaning gems!
    - I will stick by you through all the rocky roads of life! I'll be the boulder
      you can lean on.
    - I can get you some super rare gemstones. Really rare and expensive stuff, like
      Pyrite.
    - '*Pick the RED RUBY.*'
    - '*Pick the BLUE DIAMOND.*'
    - '*Pick the GREEN EMERALD.*'
    respones:
    - Uhhhh... no.... I was speaking to.. that........ rock. Yeah, the rock.
    - The one and only! I know, I know... It must be pretty overwhelming meeting
      the guy with the most impressive rock collection on Glorth.
    - It's pretty awesome isn't it? I've been collecting rocks for 571 shlooms!
    - NOBODY knows more about rocks than me. Especially not this "Geologist" guy...
    - Exactly 87 right now. One unique rock of every type. Although I had 88 not
      long ago, but I gave this alien a piece of broken quartz and told them it was
      a shark tooth to make them shut up.
    - I only know one rock collection better than my first one.... MY SECOND ONE!
      BOOM!
    - What? Who's that? No. It's Gleezer.
    - I know, I tell myself that Every day, It's all thanks to my rocks, every single
      is Sedimental to me.
    - Well it's more of a brochoure, but it's still Impressive! I'm their top reader!
    - Just a "Lousy emerald"? NO GEM IS LOUSY!! Don't you EVER say that about a gemstone
      in my presence.
    - I know. I'm pretty famous around here. I mean, I didn't MEET with her, it was
      someone picking it up for her. BUT STILL. I try not to take it for granted.
    - Ah thanks bud, but I doubt it'll replace an emer..... wait.. A HEART SHAPED
      ROCK?!? YOU'RE SO ROMANTIC!
    - Your tentacle is probably all SLIMY! I will not have my precious rocks be gooped
      on because of you.
    - Hmm, okay, but I have a couple boulders already. Couldn't hurt to have one
      more.
    - Hmm... Pyrite... I've never heard of that, it must be SUPER RARE! Rarer than
      my precious emerald... You got yourself a deal!
    - Hmm... Ruby... usually the sign of love, but this time... not the right one.
    - Hmm... Diamond, the strongest stone I have. It's nice but, not what I like...
    - This... must be fate... IT'S MEANT TO BE!!! I know you feel the same. This
      must be your dream - to get with amazing Flyynt.
    actions:
    - "*A cave is a weird location for a first date... maybe this is normal in this
      planet. Up ahead you hear talking, and what looks to be humanoid volcano polishing
      a rock.* \nShh.... Shh.... Easy there..... Daddy's got ya... OH UHHH HEY! Didn't
      see ya there, You must be my date from Glompartner.. I'm Flynnt!"
    - Who's this "Geologist" anyway? Does he have a better rock collection than me?
      I have a rare GREEN SHINY stone like you've never seen. It's the rarest in
      my collection.
    - You know, my rock collection actually got me on the front page of Rocks Monthly!
      You see, there's my interview. It has my rarest rocks, and my top 10 favourite
      band!
    - You know, the Queen once requested my best gem for her crown. You know what
      I gave her? Just a lousy diamond! Come to think of it... I only had one diamond.........
      AW DAMN IT!
    - I'm looking for a sturdy relationship, something long term ya'know. You've
      seen what I can provide, what do you bring to the table?
    - I've had a rockin' time today. Okay then, this is the last test - the compatibility
      test. Pick one of these three gems, and which one you pick will decide our
      fate as a couple.
    - Hey, that was fun. Maybe next time, bring me a big, shiny rock ;)
