--- !u!114 &2072542799
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 2072542796}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 7684a7be71ec4ca42a8995e99203673e, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  dialogue:
    name: frillish
    options:
    - '*Walk up to the alien.*'
    - Why are you standing behind a wall?
    - '*Whisper hello.*'
    - It's okay. Maybe next time it can be just us!
    - Of course, your friend seems lovely, just like you!
    - It's okay, I struggle to talk sometimes too!
    - '*Politely shake Frillish''s hand.*'
    - You both have very lovely names!
    - Nice to meet you Frillish :)
    - 'I just wanna eat you!

      *Touch their lightbulb.*'
    - This place does the best pasta! You'll love it.
    - You looked like a creamcake alien because you're sweet, so I'll get you that!
    - They're just stars.
    - Hey, I was up there not long ago... with the stars.
    - The stars glow almost as bright and beautiful as you.
    - Our food hasn't arrived, I know you want to stay for that.
    - It's been nice. I've had fun with you both.
    - Frillish. I hope we can see eachother again soon.
    respones:
    - '*The Alien suddenly turns transparent, almost invisible unless you knew they
      were there in the first place.*'
    - '(A: My friend is shy, you''re so direct!!)'
    - '*The bulb of the alien glows as they shyly wave back.*'
    - N...Next time?? Eh Ehhhhh.... This is all moving...... way too fast..... I
      want to dessert this date....
    - Y-Yes.... They are.... You're...... very sweet...
    - Y-You do??.... That's reassuring..... You're sweet.....
    - "Frillish recoils and hides behind a wall... \n(A: STAY BACK PERVERT!)"
    - "T....Thank you..... \n(A: I know we do!)"
    - N-Nice to...... meet you... too.....
    - PLEASE...... don't..... touch my lightbulb...
    - Oh..... um.... yeah... pasta.... sounds good...
    - '*Frillish''s bulb starts glowing bright. That''s probably a good sign.*'
    - '*Frillish goes invisible and hides behind the wall, and sniffling sounds start
      coming from that direction.*'
    - "Yeah..... Sure you were......  \n(A: what a liar!! you're funny with your
      crazy stories.)"
    - "Y-.... you mean it....? \n(A: WHOA  GET A ROOM!!)"
    - "Umm.... Uhh..... I.... Can't.... \n(A: GET THE HINT GLORPO!)"
    - "It has been..... nice... \n(A: This was FUN! Three friends hanging out! LOVE
      IT!)"
    - '*Frillish''s bulb glows, they get embarrased by this and covers their face.*

      (A:
      Frillish and the tentacle, sitting in a tree, K.I.S.S.I.N.G!)'
    actions:
    - '*You''re in the back of an alleyway, a sketchy place for a first date... You
      think they decided not to show up, but peeking out from behind a wall, you
      see your date, and on your date''s shoulder, a smaller alien?*

      (Smaller
      alien: HELLO! My friend is shy, so I''m here to support her!!!)'
    - I... hope it's okay.... that I brought my friend... I struggle...... to talk...
      sometimes....
    - "My name's... Frillish... \n(A: AND MY NAMES Angy!)"
    - "Shall we.... get some food?..... \n(A: Ooo food! What shall we get?!)"
    - "Wow... look at..... the stars... aren't they beautiful... \n(A: Frillish is
      OBSESSED with stars, they wont shut up about them!) \nAngy... be quiet...."
    - This is..... draining..... my social battery...... But it was.....................
      Fun....
