--- !u!114 &7584683004043763972
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 5751493418133741712}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 7684a7be71ec4ca42a8995e99203673e, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  dialogue:
    name: will
    options:
    - '*Gently shake their shoulder to wake them up.*'
    - '*Wait for them to wake up.*'
    - Excuse me... Do you want me to come back later?
    - 'Napping ruins my sleep schedule. '
    - You're funny hehe.
    - I love a good nap, you seem like a good napping companion.
    - 'No thanks, I don''t like tea. '
    - Tea? How are you going to make it? With what?
    - I'd love some! But are you sure it's okay to... Steep... together on the first
      date?
    - '*Add the red grass.*'
    - '*Add the tree leaves.*'
    - '*Add the little herbs.*'
    - '*Take the cup, and brush his hand flirtatiously.*'
    - '*Don''t take the cup.* '
    - '*Take a sip from the cup.*'
    - "Does it itch? \n*Reach out to itch their skin.*"
    - ' Is it reversable? I can get you some steroid cream? '
    - 'Or you could say you used to not like mushrooms, but they''re growing on you
      now. '
    - ' I prefer singing.

      *Start belting your favourite song.* '
    - My tentacle also has a condition where I can't control it. It's called 'Alien
      Hand Syndrome'.
    - You're the only person I want to dance with.
    respones:
    - Hey, Gluhh don't you know it's rude to touch a sleeping glomp?
    - '*The whale keeps sleeping for a long while, but eventually slowly opens its
      eyes. They take a moment to realise what''s happening, and then smiles.*'
    - '*The whale slowly opens its eyes, takes a moment to realise whats happening,
      and then smiles.*'
    - Gluh, you're too strung up. On this date, just let yourself relax with me...
    - Laughing is such a good vibe, Gluhh.
    - 'You''re welcome to come nap with me anytime, Gluhh.

      *Will winks at
      you.*'
    - 'Oh... really? Okay then, but at least you wouldn''t mind helping me make it
      then.

      *Will starts pouting and tapping his foot.*'
    - What? Gluhh are you an alien or something? We'll make it normally.
    - HAHAHAHA, I could get used to you, come help me make it!
    - Umm...  you know that's Glerble food... right? I'll just do it myself...
    - Gluh those are TREE leaves, not TEA leaves! never mind, I'll get it myself..
    - Mmm, I can smell the herbs already. Thanks, Gluhh.
    - "*They recoil.* \nI know my skin is diffent but don't touch me.."
    - Oh... Well, it's okay if someone doesn't want tea....
    - Ahhhh... It doesn't get better than this, Gluhh. Just you, me, and a nice herbal
      tea...
    - 'NO GLUH WHY DID YOU TOUCH ME?! IT''S CONTAGEOUS!!!.....

      Only joking,
      but please don''t touch me without my permission.'
    - Steroid cream?... Is that similar to glorp cream? I looooove glorp cream but
      it gives me brainfreeze...
    - You're a really fun-guy you know, I hope we can get along more.
    - "*They recoil and puts their hands over their ears.* \nThat's a bit too loud
      for me gluhh. Let's just dance in silence."
    - Embrace what your body is trying to tell you, Gluhh. Come and dance with me!
    - Gluhh, this is pretty fast for me, but come hold my hand and dance with me!
    actions:
    - '*You see a purple whale asleep in the shade under a tree, a small snot bubble,
      rises and falls from a blowhole on the top of their head.*'
    - Oh... Hey, Gluhh! Sorry about earlier, it's just so relaxing in this park that
      I fell asleep. I'm so good at relaxing that I could do it in my sleep!
    - Hey, Gluhh, how about a cup of lovely herbal tea? I'm sure it will make this
      date even better than it already is.
    - Okay, here's the pot. Add our tea in.
    - 'Mmm, I love a good cup of herbal tea... Go on have a cup.

      *They offer
      you a cup.*'
    - Hey Gluhh... Are you looking at my skin? It's okay, I don't mind. I have a
      skin condition which causes a fungus-like texture to spread. Pretty cool right?
    - That tentacle of yours is trying to dance away from you. Let's dance with it
      together!
    - 'Phew, I''m tired after all that dancing... I think.... I need another....
      cup of.......

      *Snore.* (They seem to have fallen asleep.)'
