--- !u!114 &8547519496724020380
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 4100174249136513334}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 7684a7be71ec4ca42a8995e99203673e, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  dialogue:
    name: big b
    options:
    - I'm so sorry! You were so small that I didn't see you through the grass.
    - Sorry about that, I should be more careful.
    - Grab the alien and hug them in apology.
    - You'd look handsome clean shaven.
    - It's very majestic.
    - '*Comb your fingers through the aliens beard.*

      I like it.'
    - I got a joke for you!.... You'd have to be really low to pickpocket a midget.
    - You're a real comedian!
    - Laugh so hard you fall into them.
    - It's not big, it's only a small complex!
    - I'll love you despite anything you have.
    - Can't be as big as your beard.
    - it's just that your eyes are so small!
    - I was just surprised that you have 4 eyes.
    - I'd kiss your eyes if I could.
    - I think it is time to cut this date short...
    - It has, but it's been so fun.
    - '*Caress the alien''s beard.*

      I''ll see you around... BIG B...'
    respones:
    - Small? SMALL? WHO ARE YOU CALLING SMALL, GLORPHOLE?! My name's BIG B, not Small
      B...
    - Nooo you couldn't see me, it's okay... Call me Big B.
    - Okay, okay. I forgive you.. Jeez. You didn't have to do all that. My name's
      Big B.
    - I'll have you know, I spent time and effort into this beard, and I will NOT
      be shaving it for a glorp with one tentacle.
    - I didn't like it at first, but it grew on me!
    - OOoohh it seems love is in the hair.
    - What are you trying to say... That I'm a midget? HUH? EXPLAIN YOURSELF!
    - They all laughed when I said I wanted to be a comedian... Well, they're not
      laughing now.
    - Whoa there! Didn't know I was THAT funny... You really like my jokes?
    - I'M SMALL?? SMALL HUH? I'LL SHOW YOU SMALL WHEN I MAKE A SMALL DENT IN YOUR
      FACE!!
    - Thank you friend, or maybe more than that by the end of this...
    - It is pretty big and magnificent isn't it.
    - SMALLLLLLL?!?!?!?!?!?!? HOW DARE YOUUUUUU!!!! NOTHING ABOUT ME IS SMALL!!!
      HEAR ME?? NOTHING!!!!!!!!
    - 4 eyes? That's normal for my species..... Are you okay?
    - Hey... If we go on a second date... It's on the table...
    - Short.. Haha... funny.... I don't want to act out of character. I urge you
      to leave.... NOW...
    - It has, but all good things gotta come to an end, y'know?
    - Oh my.... Yes... I'll be seeing you around. You know your way around a beard.
      ;)
    actions:
    - '*You haven''t walked far from your ship looking for your date, you''re strolling
      through a field of tall yellow grass. When you accidentally kick something
      and hear an "OOF".... An alien, which you realise is your date, flies up in
      front of you.*'
    - Hey what do you think of my beard? Do you like it? Should I shave it? Be honest...
    - "Hey, you know, I haven\u2019t slept for ten days.... because that would be
      too long."
    - I'm gonna be honest, I have a height complex, and it's a big one.
    - I noticed you were looking at my eyes... I like that you have intense eye contact.
    - Hmmm.. This HAS gone pretty well. But it's getting pretty late...
    - Maybe I'll see ya around.
--- !u!114 &9214801998530200788
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 5416819112387633065}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 7684a7be71ec4ca42a8995e99203673e, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  dialogue:
    name: Jane
    options:
    - Careful, you could crash!
    - That was dangerous.
    - Radical!
    - Looks like a really bad incident happened here...
    - I wonder who owned it.
    - Wouldn't it be awesome if we could fly it?
    - Hey, I collect stamps! Maybe we could share.
    - I didn't know you had a nerdy side, Jane.
    - What other stuff have you found?
    - Is that like McDonalds? Sorry, I don't eat fast food!
    - When you come and deliver it, can you feed it to me as well? ;D
    - "*Pick up a piece of broken off rocketship.* \nI have a gift for you too...
      It's uhhh... A rare piece of alien tech!"
    - What's this 'incident' you're on about? Why make it sound so mysterious?
    - The glorpolimpics? What's that?
    - That's INCREDIBLE! Did you win, Jane?
    - As long as you'd be able to slow down from time to time, I'm sure we could
      cherish a bunch of moments together.
    - When you put it like that, how could I say no? (sarcastically)
    - Let's live life in the fast lane together!
    respones:
    - I've lived through worse than you can imagine Amigorp... You weren't here when
      I had 'The Incident'. "You'll never recover, Jane." they said...
    - Dangerous is my middle name, Amigorp. My first is Jane.
    - Thank you Amigorp, do you want an autograph? The amazing, Jane will do anything
      for her fans! Jane always has time for a fan!... OH! YOU are my date... Not
      a fan.
    - Bad... 'Incident'? Lets- Not talk about bad incidents... Lets change the subject.
      Hey look at this cool rubble.
    - Man, that glorp must be AWESOME!! I gotta meet them one day.
    - That would be SO COOL!! Should we try?? I bet the owner would never know it
      was gone!!
    - You have very... Boring hobbies....  Bottle caps? I mean at least my stuff
      is alien and mysterious... yours is just................ yeah.....
    - It's not nerdy to collect cool things, like collectors items.
    - I found a cool clyindical thing, this rubber scarf that i'm wearing, and recently
      this rock guy gave me a real shark tooth!! He said it was super rare!
    - Well.... I'm a fast person Amigorp... I deliver FAST food, when i'm not eating
      i'm FASTing. Fast is my middle name. So is dangerous.
    - Feed it to you? Ehhh... You can't do it yourself? Strange...
    - This.... Is.... INCREDIBLE!!!!! WHOAOAOAH SO COOL! THIS IS ONE OF A KIND! THANK
      YOU AMIGORP!
    - Please... Let's not talk about 'The Incident'....
    - You dont know what the GLORLPOLIMPICS are?!? Where all the most daring competitions
      go on?!? Thats where 'The Incident' happened.
    - I KNOW RIGHT!! I would've won, it was the most incredible run in glorpolimpics
      history! But... 'The Incident'... stopped everything.
    - As long as you'd be able to slow down from time to time, I'm sure we could
      cherish a bunch of moments together.
    - Great! I'm glad we're on the same page, Amigorp!
    - Now you're spreaking my language, Amigorp!
    actions:
    - '*From the distance, you see a cloud of dust rapidly approaching you... No...
      Thats... YOUR DATE?!? They''re approaching you dangerously fast, and looks
      like they''re going to hit you! They start braking and a huge dust wave tails
      them as they impressively drift to a halt beside you, the dust flowing behind
      them*'
    - Cool place for a Speed Date right, Amigorp? You seen this rocket? Isn't it
      AWESOME?! Wonder what it was for, maybe an AWESOME stunt!
    - I love finding stuff like this... I collect interesting things, or alien items.
      So this looks cool.
    - Hey, I have a gift for you! Since it's our first date and all, it's only polite!
      I gift you..... A coupon for one free meal at McGlorps! My job as a delivery
      glorp means that I get free vouchers! AND, I will personally deliver it to
      you.
    - I was once in the glorpolimpics you know.. I would've been in it again this
      year if it wasn't for.... 'The Incident'...
    - Well... Enough of 'The Incident'... I've had a great time today... Will you
      be willing to date me, despite my glaring trauma avoidance, extreme arrogance,
      and undiagnosed ADHD?
    - It's been a blast, but I've gotta dash!
